Deploy a noisy lure that attracts all creatures within radius [4, 5, 6, 7, 8 (TL1-5)] to it for [5, 7, 9, 11, 13 (TL1-5)] turns.

It has [138, 172, 196, 214, 230 (TL1-5; CUN 100)] life (based on your Cunning) and is very durable, with [10, 15, 18, 22, 25 (TL1-5)] armor and [63%, 67%, 69%, 71%, 73% (TL1-5)] resistance to non-physical damage.

At level 5, when the lure is destroyed, it will trigger some traps in a radius of 2 around it (check individual trap descriptions to see if they are triggered).

Use of this talent will not break stealth.
